sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant SUP as Supervisor
    participant RES as Research
    participant ANA as Analysis
    participant A2A as Remote A2A
    participant REV as Review
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>API: Submit architecture request
    API->>SUP: Start LangGraph workflow
    SUP->>DB: Create task record

    SUP->>RES: Gather evidence
    RES-->>SUP: Research findings

    par Local analysis
        SUP->>ANA: Evaluate alternatives
        ANA-->>SUP: Architecture comparison
    and Remote A2A assessment
        SUP->>A2A: Delegate task via A2A
        A2A-->>SUP: Task ID and status
        SUP->>A2A: Retrieve task result
        A2A-->>SUP: Assessment artifact
    end

    SUP->>REV: Validate combined findings
    REV-->>SUP: Quality assessment

    alt Review accepted
        SUP->>DB: Store recommendation
        SUP-->>API: Structured recommendation
        API-->>User: Final response
    else Review rejected
        SUP->>DB: Store rejection
        SUP-->>API: Escalation required
        API-->>User: Review failed
    end
